{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>一名38歲男子，在新田一個魚塘溺斃。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.BODY-0900_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026epYxzAWwKq1791778869.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>警員在現場調查，男子的朋友昨晚約10時報案指事主失蹤，警員到場搜索。消防凌晨一時在魚塘找到該名男子，救起後當場證實不治。經調查，死者是非法勞工。</p><p></p><p>警方拘捕一名男子，涉嫌聘請非法勞工。案件由邊境警區重案組跟進。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.BODY-0900_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026K7ovTHOuky1791778861.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T04:58:00.196735+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}